WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:01,940
If you tell everyone your plan first

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,620
Give a buffer before implementation

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,660
Let these people jump out

4
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:05,900
You solve it one by one

5
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,420
Solve the problem and these people before implementing it

6
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,500
Wouldn't it be better this way?

7
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,460
Ensure the implementation of the new reform plan?

8
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:12,740
You are gathered together like this now

9
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:15,060
At that time, on the one hand, the implementation of the new reform plan will be promoted.

10
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,020
On the one hand, these people are doing all kinds of mischief below.

11
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,360
Don't you think the problem will be even worse?

12
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:21,000
What about the implementation issues? Let’s wait.

13
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,960
You can’t guarantee that everything will be thought through. The third point is my personal opinion.

14
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,240
a major reform plan

15
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,520
should be carefully considered

16
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,760
and conduct pilot operations

17
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,240
No matter how carefully you think about it

18
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:30,640
After all, this is a big company

19
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:32,320
And it’s a company-wide reform

20
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,400
Problems encountered in practice

21
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,840
You can't possibly take everything into consideration

22
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,920
in my opinion

23
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:37,600
You should first find a pilot area

24
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,960
Try to solve the problem while trying to make sure there is no problem.

25
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,780
further advance in an all-round way

26
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,940
I asked the doctor

27
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,420
Must stay in the hospital today

28
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:45,500
Bring down the fever first

29
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,980
Go back and have a good rest at night

30
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:47,940
Everything will be fine tomorrow morning

31
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:50,090
Only then can you go to work and not listen to me.

32
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:51,890
I'll give you a call and report it truthfully

33
00:00:51,890 --> 00:00:53,410
Let everyone know about the reform plan first

34
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:55,370
Leave a buffer period for everyone and yourself

35
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:57,610
Of course, we will make a decision after thorough argumentation.

36
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:58,570
this is just my suggestion

37
00:00:58,570 --> 00:01:01,330
What you do is your own business

38
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:02,730
Why do you know so much

39
00:01:02,730 --> 00:01:03,850
Why are you interested in the company's operations?

40
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:04,770
so clear
